W AX3038 389-unhandled-at-main.ax:121:6-7 effect-unverifiable "handled-effects list cannot be checked: the body calls a value the compiler could not resolve" ?"name the function at the call, or widen the handled list: an unresolved call may perform any effect, and reaching one with no handler aborts the process"
E AX3039 389-unhandled-at-main.ax:67:9-13 axtag-key-typo "AXTAG key typo on `Typo`: unrecognised key `unhandld`; did you mean `unhandled`?" ?"an unrecognised key is recorded and never checked, so the claim this looks like was not made. Fix the spelling, or namespace a key of your own, such as `;@axiom:my:KEY(...)`, so it cannot be mistaken for a claim"
E AX3053 389-unhandled-at-main.ax:140:6-10 unhandled-operation "`main` reaches operation `fallibleMalformed` of effect `Fallible` with no handler: the process would write `axiom: unhandled effect` and exit 71 there - main -> viaFallible" #"reaches `Fallible` with nothing handling it" ^127:6-17:"`viaFallible` performs it" ?"install one - `(handle BODY (E) HANDLER)` around the call - or, if an unhandled operation of this effect is a deliberate abort as `Assert`'s is, write `;@axiom:unhandled(trap)` above its `effect` declaration"
